# HIS WebForms Patterns

## Load dữ liệu (mẫu chuẩn)

```csharp
protected void Page_Load(object sender, EventArgs e)
{
    if (!IsPostBack)
        LoadData();
}

private void LoadData()
{
    INFO_Information info = new INFO_Information();
    DataTable dt = info.GetDataTable(
        "INFO_Information_HOS_News",
        "@LanguageID", ResManager.CurrentLanguageID,
        "@NodeID", nodeID,
        "@Top", top
    );
    if (dt != null && dt.Rows.Count > 0)
    {
        rptList.DataSource = dt;
        rptList.DataBind();
    }
}
```

## Repeater helper

```csharp
protected string GetTitle(object dataItem)
{
    DataRowView drv = dataItem as DataRowView;
    if (drv == null || !drv.Row.Table.Columns.Contains("Title"))
        return "";
    return HttpUtility.HtmlEncode(drv["Title"].ToString());
}
```

## Đa ngôn ngữ

- Resource: `ResManager.GetString("Key")`
- Cột EN khi `ResManager.CurrentLanguageID == 2`: `TitleEn`, `ContentEn`, `CategoryNameEn`
- URL EN: prefix `/en/` trong `urlrewrite.config`

## Ảnh thumbnail

```csharp
string sub = "Information" + ("000000" + infoId).Substring(("000000" + infoId).Length - 6, 6);
string url = WebGlobal.InformationThumbDirectory + "/" + sub + "/" + fileName;
```

## Cache

```csharp
string cacheKey = "INFO_LIST3_CATE_" + ResManager.CurrentLanguageID;
DataTable dt = HttpRuntime.Cache[cacheKey] as DataTable;
if (dt == null)
{
    dt = info.GetDataTable(...);
    HttpRuntime.Cache.Insert(cacheKey, dt, null,
        DateTime.Now.AddMinutes(5), Cache.NoSlidingExpiration);
}
```

## Booking API (không gọi SP trực tiếp)

```csharp
string apiLink = WebGlobal.DOMAIN_CMS_API + "/api/DoctorList";
// Header: x-api-key = WebGlobal.SEC_CMS_API
// POST AddBooking: JSON body, Newtonsoft.Json
```

## Stored procedure naming

`{Module}_{Entity}_{Action}` — ví dụ: `INFO_Information_Doctor`, `HOS_NewsDetail2_GetDetail`, `INFO_Chat_GET_ByKeyword`

## Thêm trang/section mới

1. Tạo `.ascx` + code-behind trong `Controls/InformationSection/`
2. Nếu cần URL SEO → thêm rule vào `urlrewrite.config`
3. Trang full → `Pages/InfoSection/*.aspx` dùng `BDS.Master`
4. Section trang chủ → cập nhật `CategoryIdToControlPath` trong `Home.ascx.cs`
5. Category ID mới → xác nhận với DB/CMS trước khi hardcode

