# CMS WebForms Patterns

## Cấu trúc thư mục chuẩn

```
{ProjectWeb}/
  Pages/           → trang full (.aspx + BDS.Master)
  Controls/        → UserControl (.ascx) theo module
  Utility/         → ResManager, WebGlobal wrapper, helper
  App_GlobalResources/ → Lang.resx, LangEn.resx
  App_Themes/      → CSS theo site
  urlrewrite.config → SEO routing
```

## Load data (mẫu)

```csharp
protected void Page_Load(object sender, EventArgs e)
{
    if (!IsPostBack)
        LoadData();
}

private void LoadData()
{
    INFO_Information objInfo = new INFO_Information();
    DataTable dtbData = objInfo.GetDataTable(
        "INFO_Information_List",
        "@LanguageID", ResManager.CurrentLanguageID,
        "@NodeID", lngNodeID
    );
    if (dtbData != null && dtbData.Rows.Count > 0)
    {
        rptList.DataSource = dtbData;
        rptList.DataBind();
    }
}
```

## Entity CRUD

```csharp
SYS_Counter objItem = new SYS_Counter();
objItem.ID = lngID;
objItem.Get();           // load 1 record
objItem.GetByLink();     // load theo slug/link
objItem.Update();
objItem.Add();
```

## Đa ngôn ngữ

- `ResManager.CurrentLanguageID` — 1=VI, 2=EN
- `ResManager.GetString("Key")` từ Lang.resx / LangEn.resx
- Cột EN: `TitleEn`, `ContentEn` khi `CurrentLanguageID == 2`
- URL EN: prefix `/en/` trong `urlrewrite.config`

## URL / SEO

- Thêm route → `urlrewrite.config` (UrlRewritingNet)
- Query: `slug`, `iid`, `cate`, `lang`
- 404: `NotFoundHelper.TransferToNotFound()` hoặc `Server.Transfer("~/NotFound.aspx")`
- Ảnh: `WebGlobal.InformationThumbDirectory` + pad 6 số `Information{000000}`

## Cache

```csharp
string strCacheKey = "LIST_" + ResManager.CurrentLanguageID + "_" + lngCateID;
DataTable dtbCached = HttpRuntime.Cache[strCacheKey] as DataTable;
```

## Repeater / Grid helper

```csharp
protected string GetField(object dataItem, string strColumn)
{
    DataRowView drv = dataItem as DataRowView;
    if (drv == null || !drv.Row.Table.Columns.Contains(strColumn))
        return "";
    return HttpUtility.HtmlEncode(drv[strColumn].ToString());
}
```

## Thêm tính năng mới — checklist

1. UserControl trong `Controls/{Module}/`
2. Trang full trong `Pages/{Module}/` nếu cần
3. Rule `urlrewrite.config` nếu có URL SEO
4. Key Lang.resx + LangEn.resx
5. Stored proc trong `*Object` project — không viết SQL trong web
